sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Pessoa
    participant CLI as sk account delete (a implementar)
    participant Receiver as core-account-receiver
    participant N as NATS JetStream
    participant MGR as core-account-manager
    participant DB as SSOT PostgreSQL
    participant REC as core-account-reconciler
    participant OBS as core-account-observer
    participant EXE as core-account-executor
    participant ZIT as Zitadel

    Note over U,ZIT: A remoção é declarativa: o desired passa a lifecycle absent, sem dados pessoais. O registro só sai do SSOT depois que a ausência é observada.

    rect rgb(232,245,233)
    Note over U,ZIT: A. Caminho perfeito
    U->>CLI: sk account delete
    CLI->>Receiver: GET /v1/core/accounts/{id} (lê resourceVersion)
    Receiver-->>CLI: 200 {resourceVersion 4}
    CLI->>Receiver: DELETE /v1/core/accounts/{id}?resourceVersion=4 (Bearer, role core.account.delete)
    Receiver->>N: receiver.requested.core.account.{id}.delete
    Receiver-->>CLI: 202 {operationId}
    N->>MGR: requested delete
    MGR->>DB: trava a linha, confere a versão, desired lifecycle absent (sem e-mail e nomes), phase Deleting, outbox desired
    N->>REC: desired absent
    REC->>N: action delete (observação de no máximo 5 min)
    N->>EXE: action delete
    EXE->>ZIT: remove o usuário
    EXE->>N: completed
    OBS->>ZIT: GET usuário
    ZIT-->>OBS: 404
    OBS->>N: observed presence = absent
    N->>MGR: observed absent
    MGR->>DB: DELETE da linha, Operation completed, outbox updated {removed true}
    CLI->>Receiver: GET /v1/core/accounts/{id}/operations/{operationId}
    Receiver-->>CLI: 200 completed
    CLI-->>U: "Conta removida."
    Note over N: O último desired (absent) permanece em DESIRED como tombstone até a limpeza administrativa.
    end

    rect rgb(255,235,238)
    Note over U,ZIT: B. Problemas
    CLI->>Receiver: DELETE com resourceVersion antiga
    Receiver-->>CLI: 409 Conflict (o Receiver antecipa), ou Operation rejected conflict vinda do Manager
    CLI-->>U: "O recurso mudou. Leia de novo e repita."
    CLI->>Receiver: DELETE de outro usuário
    Receiver-->>CLI: 404 (operadores core.account.admin podem)
    CLI->>Receiver: DELETE sem a role core.account.delete
    Receiver-->>CLI: 403
    CLI->>Receiver: DELETE de usuário já removido
    Receiver-->>CLI: 404
    EXE->>ZIT: remove usuário
    ZIT--xEXE: erro
    EXE->>N: failed, retry com backoff, limite 5 e suspensão (ver 05)
    OBS->>ZIT: leitura inconclusiva durante a remoção
    OBS->>N: observed unknown (nunca absent): a remoção não converge por engano
    Note over U: Limitação conhecida: a ordem de remoção entre recursos dependentes (um usuário dono<br/>de Organizations) não está definida e deve ser tratada pelo domínio.
    end
